// Table: Balance Sheet
// Display folder: 02-kpi
// Format: #,##0
// Hidden: false
// Duration NetCashProvidedByUsedInFinancingActivities at the latest period_end (is_latest_filing). 10-Q may be YTD.

Cash from Financing =
